This distribution provides a C#/.NET Windows Forms implementation, selective
optimization and cleanup, AppX/startup management, network diagnostics,
Windows repairs, durable setting backups and verification tools.

Published self-contained executables include Microsoft .NET, Windows Forms
and Windows SDK projection components. Runtime license and notice files are
provided alongside the executables in full Portable releases.
